throat (ENT) disorders and surgeries (including but not limited to Adenoidectomy, Mastoidectomy, Tonsillectomy and Tympanoplasty), Nasal Septum Deviation, Sinusitis and related disorders; (iii) Benign Prostatic Hypertrophy; (iv) Cataract; (v) Dilatation and Curettage; (vi) Fissure/ Fistula in anus, Hemorrhoids/ Piles, Pilonidal Sinus, Ulcers of Gastro Intestinal tract; (vii) Surgery of Genito urinary system unless necessitated by malignancy; (viii) All types of Hernia, Hydrocele; (ix) Hysterectomy for

unless necessitated by malignancy; (viii) All types of Hernia, Hydrocele; (ix) Hysterectomy for menorrhagia or fibromyoma or prolapse of uterus unless necessitated by malignancy; (x) Internal tumors, skin tumors, cysts, nodules, polyps including breast lumps (each of any kind) unless malignant; (xi) Kidney Stone/ Ureteric Stone/ Lithotripsy/ Gall Bladder Stone; (xii) Myomectomy for fibroids; (xiii) Varicose veins and varicose ulcers;
